===============================================================================
SCOPE: THIS LICENCE COVERS OUR OWN CODE ONLY
===============================================================================

The MIT licence above applies to the code written for this project. It does NOT
apply to the datasets, the third-party code included or vendored here, or the
model weights any of it downloads. Those carry their own terms, and several are
more restrictive than MIT.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
DATASETS  (data/raw/)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The 21 credit-risk datasets are NOT ours and are NOT redistributable under this
licence. They are gitignored for that reason. Several are proprietary and
anonymised (marked as such in src/data/dataset_registry.py); the public ones
carry their own source terms. Do not redistribute any of them, and check the
originating terms before publishing anything derived from them.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
VENDORED AND COPIED CODE
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
src/models/nanotabiclv2.py
    Generated by scripts/vendor_model.py from NanoTabICL
    (github.com/soda-inria/nanotabicl), MIT licensed. Copyright its authors
    (Qu, Holzmüller, Varoquaux, Le Morvan; Inria Soda).

src/data/dataset_preprocessing.py
src/data/dataset_registry.py
    Copied from the sibling TabPFNCredit project, same author and institution.

src/prior/  (functions.py, base.py, and the sampling logic)
    Reimplements the TabICLv2 synthetic prior, following NanoTabICL and
    github.com/soda-inria/tabicl (both MIT). Our credit-specific additions are
    original; the mechanisms they build on are not.

tfm-library/
    A pinned, READ-ONLY git submodule with its own licence and its own terms.
    Nothing in it is covered here. See tfm-library/AGENTS.md.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
MODEL WEIGHTS PULLED AT RUN TIME
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
TabPFN (the `tabpfn` package, used only as an evaluation baseline)
    Its weights are licence-gated: you must accept Prior Labs' terms at
    https://ux.priorlabs.ai/account and supply a TABPFN_TOKEN. Those terms are
    NOT MIT and at the time of writing restrict commercial use. Read them before
    relying on any TabPFN result, and note this project only ever runs TabPFN for
    comparison — its prior is never modified.

TabICL (the `tabicl` package and checkpoints/)
    MIT licensed. The released TabICLv2 checkpoints under checkpoints/ are not
    ours and are gitignored.

CatBoost — Apache 2.0.
scikit-learn, PyTorch, NumPy, pandas — BSD-style.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
IF YOU PUBLISH RESULTS FROM THIS REPOSITORY
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Cite TabICL and TabICLv2 (Qu et al. 2025, 2026) for the architecture and the
prior this work modifies, TabPFN for any baseline comparison, and record the
pinned tfm-library commit for any claim that rests on the literature.
